  "body": "This adds support for the `transformItems` option on widgets.\r\n\r\n## How\r\n\r\nThe implementation was made at the connector level for the following reasons:\r\n\r\n- The transformation takes place before the rendering\r\n- Leverage the `transformItems` API in all flavors (since the connectors are/will be shared across InstantSearch libraries)\r\n\r\n## How to review\r\n\r\nEach commit is a widget implementation. Click on the commit and add your review there.\r\n\r\n[See commits →](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/3042/commits)\r\n\r\n## Supported widgets\r\n\r\n- [x] [BreadCrumb](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/breadcrumb.html)\r\n- [x] [CurrentRefinedValues](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/currentRefinedValues.html)\r\n- [x] [GeoSearch](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/geoSearch.html)\r\n- [x] [HierarchicalMenu](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/hierarchicalMenu.html)\r\n- [x] [Hits](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/hits.html)\r\n- [x] [HitsPerPageSelector](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/hitsPerPageSelector.html)\r\n- [x] [InfiniteHits](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/infiniteHits.html)\r\n- [x] [Menu](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/menu.html)\r\n- [x] [MenuSelect](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/menuSelect.html)\r\n- [x] [NumericRefinementList](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/numericRefinementList.html)\r\n- [x] [NumericSelector](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/numericSelector.html)\r\n- [x] [RefinementList](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/refinementList.html)\r\n- [x] [SortBySelector](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/sortBySelector.html)\r\n\r\nThese widgets have been selected based on whether they contain items and based on the current React InstantSearch API. Let me know if this list should be updated.\r\n\r\n[See all InstantSearch.js widgets →](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets.html)\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>React InstantSearch widgets implementing <code>transformItems</code></summary>\r\n\r\n- Breadcrumb\r\n- ClearRefinements\r\n- CurrentRefinements\r\n- HierarchicalMenu\r\n- HitsPerPage\r\n- Menu\r\n- MenuSelect\r\n- NumericMenu\r\n- RefinementList\r\n- SortBy\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCloses #2949 ",
